Package: spiSEE
Title: Interactive Exploration of Cell-Resolution Spatial Transcriptomics with iSEE
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R:
    c(person("Emile", "Danvin", email = "emile.danvin@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-0913-6893")),
    person("Dario", "Righelli", email = "dario.righelli@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1504-3583")))
Description: Provides reusable iSEE panels for interactive exploration of
    cell-resolution spatial transcriptomics data stored in SpatialExperiment
    objects. Supports CosMx, Xenium and cell-segmented Visium HD data, with
    coordinated region selection across spatial visualisations,
    quality-control summaries and spatial analyses. Panels can be combined
    with standard iSEE panels to explore gene expression, spatial statistics,
    cellular neighbourhoods and spatial domains.
